      <p>This section applies to business customers, which under section 3 is everybody we supply. If you nevertheless ordered as a consumer, this section does not apply to you at all — an indemnity of this kind cannot be imposed on a consumer, and a clause that pretended otherwise would be void rather than merely unused.</p>

